For $j\neq k$, Theorem \ref{thm:SD_MBP} gives
$\mu_{j}=\mathrm{O}\left(\left\| \S\right\| \right)$ .
For $j=k$, combining \eqref{eq:lambda}-\eqref{eq:mu} with equation \eqref{eq:lam_sum1} implies
